{"seq":34,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0920"},"reason":"The sentence in which Amulius orders the twins drowned now gives his motive and notes that Rome's first historian, Fabius Pictor (c. 215–200 BC), already told it; the table gains Amulius' row.","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",424],["-","Amulius"],["+","Amulius,"],["=",1],["+","fearing that the boys would one day claim the throne he had usurped, "],["=",10],["-","drowned,"],["+","drowned"],["=",1],["+","– a detail already told by Rome's first historian, Quintus Fabius Pictor, who wrote between about 215 and 200 BC – "],["=",476],["+","Amulius | usurping king of Alba Longa, ordered the twins drowned |\n| "],["=",223]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",386],["-","Amulius"],["+","Amulius,"],["=",1],["+","der fürchtete, die Knaben könnten eines Tages den Thron zurückfordern, den er an sich gerissen hatte, "],["=",8],["-","ertränken,"],["+","ertränken"],["=",1],["+","– ein Zug, den schon Roms erster Geschichtsschreiber Quintus Fabius Pictor erzählte, der zwischen etwa 215 und 200 v. Chr. schrieb –, "],["=",472],["+","Amulius | Usurpator auf dem Thron von Alba Longa, ließ die Zwillinge aussetzen |\n| "],["=",205]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",350],["-","Амулий"],["+","Амулий,"],["=",1],["+","боясь, что мальчики однажды потребуют захваченный им трон, "],["=",4],["-","младенцев,"],["+","младенцев"],["=",1],["+","— эту подробность рассказывал уже первый римский историк Квинт Фабий Пиктор, писавший примерно между 215 и 200 годами до н. э., — "],["=",404],["+","Амулий | узурпатор трона Альба-Лонги, велевший утопить близнецов |\n| "],["=",187]]}],"hash":"7a1fdf50492f"},
